### Roteiro de teste (IntelliJ HTTP Client). Rode na ordem.

### 1. Cadastrar organizador (público)
POST http://localhost:8080/organizadores
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Ana Organizadora", "email": "ana@org.com", "senha": "123456" }

### 2. Login do organizador -> guarda o token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/organizadores/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@org.com", "senha": "123456" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenOrg", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Criar evento (só organizador)
POST http://localhost:8080/eventos
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOrg}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Semana de TI", "descricao": "Palestras", "local": "Auditório",
  "data": "2027-05-10", "hora": "19:00:00", "capacidade": 50 }

### 4. Cadastrar participante no evento 1 (público)
POST http://localhost:8080/participantes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Bruno", "email": "bruno@mail.com", "senha": "abcdef", "eventoId": 1 }

### 5. Login do participante -> guarda o token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/participantes/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bruno@mail.com", "senha": "abcdef" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenPart", response.body.token); %}

### 6. Participante vê o próprio cadastro (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/participantes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPart}}

### 7. Participante tentando criar evento (403)
POST http://localhost:8080/eventos
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPart}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "X", "descricao": "X", "local": "X", "data": "2027-05-10", "hora": "19:00:00", "capacidade": 1 }

### 8. Sem token em rota protegida (401)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/eventos/1

### 9. Organizador lista participantes (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/participantes?eventoId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOrg}}
